STRING 118
{
Tag-like map with dozens of races. Hide, develop, and kill the Ancient before he reaches lvl 20 to ensure your victory.

If you have any suggestions add me on battle net: CaptainAlex#21751|n

You can also join our discord: https://discord.gg/q7r7wDbpq6
}

STRING 119
{
Nikkone
}

STRING 120
{
By Nikkone, Moose, Druides
