STRING 121
{
Forest Expansion 3.2.0 Lua r14
}

STRING 122
{
|cffDE104AExpanders:
Many expanders from all over the world have found a forest with rich resources and plan to dominate it
-Find resources
-Create bases, defenses, and armies
-Kill the Ancient|r

|cff087BD6Ancient:
The Ancients of the forest will not sit down for this invasion, they will purge the forest of all expanders.
-Reach level 20 to claim victory
-Kill the expanders for gold & experience|r

Please read the quests for an update!
}

