-ban (race) |cff80ffffBans a race. |cffff80ffWorks only the first 20 seconds|r|r
-setfeed (1 - 11 or red - darkgreen) (from 50 to 200) |cff80ffffSets a feedrate%.|cffff80ff Works only the first 60 seconds.|r|n-setfeed (50 - 200) sets everyone's feed to fixed%; example "-setfeed 150"
-setfeed x(0.5-2) multiplies everyone's current feedrate; example "-setfeed x1.25"
|cff00cf00Ancient only:|r
-tradeoff |cff80ffffDisables trade globally. |cffff80ffWorks only the first 60 seconds|r|r
