STRING 813
{
Trade is now disabled by default.
Flags no longer buildable outside of base locations.
Fixed some ancient items being destructible.
Fixes various descriptions stating wrong things.
Buffed: Blood mage dark blood spell, Furbold shaman totem of destruction spell, Sand spellbringer activation time.
Nerfed: Primordial Ooze HP, Wildkin HP upgrade, Human gate feed, Goblin IE-27 slow effect reduced for melee.
For full changelog visit hiveworkshop.
}

