STRING 973
{
How To Play
}

STRING 974
{
|cff8080ffExpanders:|r
Your job is to keep the ancient away from you, gain resources, and eliminate the ancient. You may harvest gold from piles around the map, to find gold, type -gold. You must attack the Gold Pile in order to recieve gold.

|cff00cf00Ancient:|r
Your job is destroy all Expanders and their buildings. You level up by destroying buildings. You also gain gold by either destroying buildings or killing Expanders. Once you reach level 20, you win the game.
}

