STRING 2143
{
Fixed burrowed nerubian harvesters giving 2 gold instead of 20
Fixed name file resetting each time you play ancient
Upgraded human walls now feed 20 gold
Upgraded ogre walls now feed 20 gold
-feedrates command now shows players colors
Expanders can now check abilities of an ancient via typing -Ancient
Fixed Wildkin shaman's bloodlust not working on expanders
Fixed Arcanum of Hatred not dealing damage
Light's spellbringer is now unit targeted. Mana cost reduced from 75 to 50. Damage to summoned units increased from 200 to 1000
Fixed high elf wall description wrongly stating it has 600 hp by default
Added command to takeover leaver ancient

}

