STRING 6783
{
Minor terrain changes aimed at removing spots where you could accidentally get stack in trees while blinking. 
Minions now spawn 6 minutes into the game (5 minutes since ancient has spawned). If someone died earlier, you'd have to wait till spawn. Such a spawn would be in center of the map. 
Red player can now multiply feedrate of all players or set them all to static values, via commands such as -setfeed x1.5 -setfeed 150. Max value is still capped at 200. 
Razormane:
Scouts invisibility duration decreased from 120s to 15s. CD decreased from 120 to 30s.
Nerubian:
Workers can now build spires again. 
Maexxna now gets 15% move speed bonus instead of 15% move speed slow during windwalk.
Centaur:
Centaur. Main centaur move speed upgrade now increases duration of sprint by 1s.
Centaur. Watch tower lumber cost increased from 50 to 100
Ogre:
Now does provide 20 food by default. 
Fire pit food given increased from 50 to 60
Sand tower cost decreased from 250 lumber to 100
Rocky tower cost decreased from 350 lumber to 200.
Ogre head smasher. Gold cost decreased from 15 to 12.
Ogre head smasher. Move speed increased from 300 to 320
Ogre shaman. Bloodlust no longer works on expanders.
Wildkin:
Wildkin Shaman. Lumber cost increased from 800 to 1200
Wildkin Shaman. Bloodlust manacost increased from 50 to 75. 
Fixed moonblast damage being lower (300/350/400/450/500 instead of advertised 300/400/500/600/700)
Spells now deal spell damage properly. This does mean spells that dealt % of mana as a damage no longer ignore magic resist, mana shield, etc. As a compensation these spells deal 33% extra damage now, so their damage would be approximately the same.
For more information check hive workshop.
}

