STRING 7352
{
|cffFF0000Your base does not heal you in combat!|r - Fountain regeneration now ticks every four seconds of game time, and if you are attacked by anything your next tick of regeneration will not occur. Regeneration per tick is now based on current health/mana, at 25% of your current life/mana. This means if you go out and get smashed hard you'll have to wait longer to be topped off, but if you don't get hurt too bad you'll regenerate quickly.
}

