STRING 9494
// Units: O004 (Ancient of Fire), Ubertip (Tooltip - Extended)
{
|cffFF8040Difficulty:|r |cffFFFF00Medium|r
|cffFF8040Strong Against:|r Solos & Armies
|cffFF8040Weak Against:|r Bases
|cffFF8040Attributes:|r |cffff004060(+8)|r |cff00ff0050(+10)|r |cff0090ff50(+5)|r|n
This ancient excels at hunting down and killing any expanders left in the open. Being one of the only ancients with a windwalk, you will passively apply pressure to any expanders that are out in the open. You can hunt down and kill them before they have an opportunity to set up any defenses.
}

STRING 9495
// Units: O008 (Ancient of Ice), Ubertip (Tooltip - Extended)
{
|cffFF8040Difficulty:|r |cff80FFFFVery Easy|r
|cffFF8040Strong Against:|r Everything
|cffFF8040Weak Against:|r Nothing
|cffFF8040Attributes:|r |cffff004060(+8)|r |cff00ff0050(+10)|r |cff0090ff50(+5)|r|n
This ancient excels at mapwide pressure and strong presence. He has very powerful heals that scale with mana and health percentages. His damage can hit the entire map to grant him high amounts of experience and gold against weaker targets.
}

STRING 9496
// Units: O00A (Ancient of Darkness), Ubertip (Tooltip - Extended)
{
|cffFF8040Difficulty:|r |cffFFFF00Medium|r
|cffFF8040Strong Against:|r Bases & Militaries
|cffFF8040Weak Against:|r Solos
|cffFF8040Attributes:|r |cffff004060(+8)|r |cff00ff0050(+7)|r |cff0090ff50(+5)|r

This ancient is a powerful summoner. He is very strong in the early game and will dominate the map with his towers and stalkers. His ultimate summons a Dark Figure which can very helpful. 
}

