STRING 9520
// Units: O016 (Ancient of Lightning), Ubertip (Tooltip - Extended)
{
|cffFF8040Difficulty:|r |cffFFFF00Medium|r
|cffFF8040Strong Against:|r Bases & Militaries
|cffFF8040Weak Against:|r Solos
|cffFF8040Attributes:|r |cffff004060(+8)|r |cff00ff0050(+10)|r |cff0090ff50(+5)|r|n
An ancient specialized for destroying bases. Has an unlimited range nuke to gain experience around the map. Can kill towers without being in melee range. Weak against carry characters.
}

STRING 9521
// Units: h06H (|cff909090Elite Bounty Hunter|r), Tip (Tooltip - Basic)
{
|cff909090Elite Bounty Hunter|r
}

STRING 9522
// Units: O01V (Ancient of Light), Ubertip (Tooltip - Extended)
{
|cffFF8040Difficulty:|r |cff00FF00Easy|r
|cffFF8040Strong Against:|r Bases & Solos
|cffFF8040Weak Against:|r Militaries
|cffFF8040Attributes:|r |cffff004060(+8)|r |cff00ff0050(+7)|r |cff0090ff50(+5)|r|n
This ancient is specialized in defense and passivity. She is granted passive experience per second, and has a huge arsenal of heals and protective abilities. The goal of this ancient is to survive until level 20, moreso than any other ancient. Her ultimate guarantees her safety, and an easy trip to level 20.
}

STRING 9523
// Units: O01X (Ancient of Sand), Ubertip (Tooltip - Extended)
{
|cffFF8040Difficulty:|r |cffc00040Very Hard|r
|cffFF8040Strong Against:|r Solos & Militaries
|cffFF8040Weak Against:|r Bases|r
|cffFF8040Attributes:|r |cffff004060(+8)|r |cff00ff0050(+7)|r |cff0090ff50(+0)|r|n|nThis ancient is very strong at seizing map control early and keeping it. Against a team which does not have bases, the Ancient of Sand really shines with his ability to trap the map and keep vision on everyone. His sandstorm ability allows him to keep up by using it for experience.
}

STRING 9524
// Units: h06H (|cff909090Elite Bounty Hunter|r), Ubertip (Tooltip - Extended)
{
|cff008000Role|r: Hunter|n
|cff008000Off Role|r: None|n
|cff8080FFDifficulty|r: |cffff0000Hard|r|n
|cffFF8F40Move Speed|r: 320
|cffFF8Fa0Attack Cooldown|r: 1.6|n
|cffC0C0C0The Bounty Hunter is a skirmisher whose role is harassing the Ancient and profiting off it. He receives both gold and lumber from striking enemy units rather than collecting gold from piles. For the latter job, he has assigned his trusty worker companion Silvester. However, despite his offensive role, the Bounty Hunter is initially very vulnerable, and requires upgrades to gain mobility, although never gaining much durability, making him a challenging Expander to play as.|r
}

